	(text "Sense: 100 k / 220 k (5 V -> 3.4 V, 50 V clamps at 0.46 mA) into the 74HC165, whose input clamp holds the node at 3.3 V.\nLoad: COMB -- 33 k -- red LED -- pin (output pulls low, COM on a rail); green LED back (output drives high, COM on GND).\nJP2: COMB to RAILB (pads 1-2), to GND (pads 2-3), or open (switch simulation, sense only).\nDrive: BSS123 drain on the pin (100 V), gate from the 74HCT595 chain, 100 k pull-down: off until the firmware enables it."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 12.7 0)
		(effects
